  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Deep under Southern Border, on the walls of a small Earth Trench, Fang Yuan finds a field of pink grassland. Each stalk is thin and long, resembling fur, and moves without wind. He names it earth dream fetus hair and has Meng Qiu Zhen store it with dream path methods. Maps and methods from Paradise Earth inheritance and Mushroomman Paradise list locations of dream path immortal materials underground; earth dream fetus hair is one of them.",
