    {
      "text": "In Meng Zhen immortal aperture, a field of pink grassland at the center is the earth dream fetus hair dug from Southern Border’s underground. It is listed with nine tune dream flower, dream river water, tongue tip small dream fish, and dream sand as dream path Gu materials obtained in that period, still rare in the present world.",
